            "review_title": "Review at Legend Seafood & Hotpot",
            "review_text": "charstorti\nBrisbane, Australia75 contributions\n0\nAussies and Kiwis stay away\nSep 2018 • Couples\nMy husband and I visited this establishment on Sept 5th 2018. We walked in and were offered inside or outside, we chose outside. Ordered a bourbon and coke, husband a Heineken. 10 minutes later,.... Waiting, got up and found a waiter, asked if we could order more drinks, yes..... 15 minutes later we got up and walked out. Dearest bar in Hanoi with worst service. I don't mind paying big prices when the service is good, yours is not. Twice the price of everywhere else. Would not recommend.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 5, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
