            "review_title": "Review at Legend Seafood & Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Joshjacksdad\nStockport, United Kingdom128 contributions\n0\nGreat location, poor beer\nMay 2017 • Friends\nVisited for a couple of cold beers rather than to eat so can't comment of food. \nThe Good - the balcony gives fantastic views of the lake but also the chaos that is the road junction at the top of the lake. It's a great place to sit and people watch and wonder why there aren't more accidents! \nThe Bad - the beer wasn't that cold, was flat and is expensive. \nI'm sure if you drank something other than beer it might be much better so please don't judge just on my one bad factor. It is a great place to watch the world go by (and somehow not get run over). Worth a visit at least once.\nRead more\nWritten June 10, 2017",
